OL,3,CWelsh Rugby Union received nearly #10m
OL,4,Cfrom new URC deal, ITV News understands
OL,6,FThe Welsh Rugby Union received nearly
OL,7,F#10 million from a deal involving the
OL,8,FUnited Rugby Championship last month,
OL,9,FITV News understands.
OL,11,FThe payment comes as the governing
OL,12,Fbody presses ahead with controversial
OL,13,Fplans to reduce Wales's four
OL,14,Fprofessional men's teams to three from
OL,15,Fthe 2028/29 season.
OL,1,W~s1{$~k4{$k7                    G1/11
OL,2,W,.!/  +.!/*%*%R,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
