OL,24,ANext Page BNat Sport CNat Radio FRewind
FL,306,300,200,120,000,100
PN,30502
SC,0002
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F305A1793022500
OL,3,CWelsh Rugby Union received nearly #10m
OL,4,Cfrom new URC deal, ITV News understands
OL,6,FSources familiar with the matter say
OL,7,Fthe clubs were unaware of the deal
OL,8,Funtil after it had completed, when
OL,9,Fthey learned of it through the league
OL,10,Frather than from the Welsh Rugby
OL,11,FUnion. Asked directly whether that
OL,12,Faccount was correct, the WRU did not
OL,13,Fanswer, citing commercial
OL,14,Fsensitivities.
OL,16,FThe union also declined to confirm the
OL,17,Fpayment or say whether any of the
OL,18,Fmoney would be passed to Cardiff,
OL,19,FDragons, Ospreys and Scarlets.
OL,1,W~s1{$~k4{$k7                    G2/11
