OL,3,CWelsh Rugby Union received nearly #10m
OL,4,Cfrom new URC deal, ITV News understands
OL,6,FSubscribe free to our weekly
OL,7,Fnewsletter for exclusive and original
OL,8,Fcoverage from ITV News. Direct to your
OL,9,Finbox every Friday morning.
OL,11,FThe WRU announced in the summer that
OL,12,FCardiff and the Newport-based Dragons
OL,13,Fwould be offered the opportunity to be
OL,14,Ftwo of the three surviving clubs. That
OL,15,Fleaves Swansea-based Ospreys and
OL,16,FLlanelli's Scarlets competing for the
OL,17,Flast remaining spot.
OL,1,W~s1{$~k4{$k7                    G3/11
