OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F305A1793022500
OL,3,CWelsh Rugby Union received nearly #10m
OL,4,Cfrom new URC deal, ITV News understands
OL,6,FWRU chief executive Abi Tierney
OL,7,Fpreviously told ITV News it cannot
OL,8,Fgenerate enough revenue to fund four
OL,9,Fcompetitive teams beyond 2028.
OL,11,FThe teams currently play in the United
OL,12,FRugby Championship alongside clubs
OL,13,Ffrom Ireland, Scotland, Italy and
OL,14,FSouth Africa. The five national rugby
OL,15,Funions and private equity firm CVC
OL,16,FCapital Partners are the league's
OL,17,Fshareholders.
OL,1,W~s1{$~k4{$k7                    G4/11
OL,2,W,.!/  +.!/*%*%R,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
