OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F305A1793022500
OL,3,CWelsh Rugby Union received nearly #10m
OL,4,Cfrom new URC deal, ITV News understands
OL,6,FWhen CVC first invested in the league
OL,7,Fin 2020, the WRU received a share of
OL,8,Fthe proceeds. In 2021, then chief
OL,9,Fexecutive Steve Phillips said the
OL,10,Fmoney was "included in the regional
OL,11,Ffunding", describing the four Welsh
OL,12,Fclubs as its ultimate beneficiaries.
OL,14,FA WRU spokesperson said: "The WRU's
OL,15,Fannual accounts will be published very
OL,16,Fsoon and give our clubs, supporters
OL,17,Fand anyone with an interest full and
OL,18,Fcomplete access to the finances of
OL,19,FWelsh rugby recorded in the last
OL,20,Ffinancial year and reference any
OL,21,Frecent events.
