OL,3,CWelsh Rugby Union received nearly #10m
OL,4,Cfrom new URC deal, ITV News understands
OL,6,F"However, due to commercial
OL,7,Fsensitivities involving other parties,
OL,8,Fwe are unable to provide any
OL,9,Fadditional information at this time."
OL,11,FAn Irish company filing shows that Pro
OL,12,FRugby Championship DAC, which operates
OL,13,Fthe competition, issued 1,378 new
OL,14,Fshares to Pentagon UK Bidco, a CVC-
OL,15,Fcontrolled entity, in September. That
OL,16,Fincreased Pentagon's holding, while
OL,17,FCeltic Rugby DAC, through which the
OL,18,Funions hold their interest, remained
OL,19,Fthe other shareholder.
