OL,3,CWelsh Rugby Union received nearly #10m
OL,4,Cfrom new URC deal, ITV News understands
OL,6,FThe filing does not explain the
OL,7,Fpayment ITV News understands was made
OL,8,Fto the WRU. But board minutes
OL,9,Fpublished by Scottish Rugby earlier
OL,10,Fthis year show that it expected one-
OL,11,Foff income from a payment related to a
OL,12,FCVC transaction, followed by lower
OL,13,Fannual URC income in future.
OL,1,W~s1{$~k4{$k7                    G7/11
