OL,3,CWelsh Rugby Union received nearly #10m
OL,4,Cfrom new URC deal, ITV News understands
OL,6,FIn March, the Financial Times reported
OL,7,Fthat one of the world's biggest
OL,8,Fprivate equity firms, KKR, was
OL,9,Fexpected to invest in Global Sport
OL,10,FGroup (GSG), the CVC entity that holds
OL,11,Fits sports investments. A public KKR
OL,12,Finvestor presentation later listed GSG
OL,13,Famong companies it had helped finance
OL,14,Fthis year.
OL,16,FKKR, CVC and the United Rugby
OL,17,FChampionship declined to comment.
OL,1,W~s1{$~k4{$k7                    G8/11
OL,2,W,.!/  +.!/*%*%R,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
