OL,3,CWelsh Rugby Union received nearly #10m
OL,4,Cfrom new URC deal, ITV News understands
OL,6,FThe WRU's plans to cut a professional
OL,7,Fteam are also being challenged in
OL,8,Fcourt. In papers filed last month,
OL,9,Flawyers acting for Swansea Council
OL,10,Fallege that the governing body
OL,11,Fbreached competition law by abusing
OL,12,Fits dominant position over
OL,13,Fprofessional rugby licences to protect
OL,14,FCardiff, which it owns, leaving
OL,15,FOspreys and Scarlets to compete for
OL,16,Fjust one licence in the west.
OL,1,W~s1{$~k4{$k7                    G9/11
OL,2,W,.!/  +.!/*%*%R,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,RpppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/sport
