OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F305A1793022500
OL,3,CWelsh Rugby Union received nearly #10m
OL,4,Cfrom new URC deal, ITV News understands
OL,6,FAmong other things, the claim points
OL,7,Fto the WRU's former chair telling a
OL,8,FSenedd committee that the union had
OL,9,Fpromised Cardiff's prospective buyer
OL,10,Fthe capital licence to preserve its
OL,11,Fvalue.
OL,13,FThe council is seeking a declaration
OL,14,Ffrom the court that the decision made
OL,15,Fto base only one team west of Cardiff
OL,16,Fis void, including an injunction which
OL,17,Fwould prevent the union from its
OL,18,Fimplementation.
OL,1,W~s1{$~k4{$k7                   G10/11
